From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Mon, 23 Mar 2026 16:08:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/40] Add dialog task detection and IsDialogTask metadata for
 modal windows

SurfaceFlinger detects dialog tasks by scanning for
TYPE_APPLICATION_ATTACHED_DIALOG (type=1003) and "Dim Layer for" named
layers. When detected, the container displayFrame is shrunk to the
content bounds, dim/container layers are excluded from client
composition, and IsDialogTask metadata is sent to HWC so the Wayland
side can create a modal Chrome window (CONTAINER_OVERLAY) instead of a
normal app window.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
